          "kind": "quiz",
          "question": "\"tac\" also sums to 312. With 7 buckets, which bucket does it go to?",
          "code": null,
          "options": ["Bucket 2", "Bucket 4", "Bucket 6", "Bucket 0"],
          "correct": [1],
          "explanation": "312 mod 7 is 4 (7 × 44 = 308), the same bucket as \"cat\" and \"act\": anagrams always collide under this hash."
